    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Bellhop, maintaining the smooth operation of a small hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tips by fulfilling daily clients' needs for food, coffee, towels and beddings. Improve and upgrade your tools of the trade to fulfill needs faster and earn bigger tips.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun gameplay loop based on meeting the daily needs of clients. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels throughout four seasons that introduce unique challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and buy upgrades with the tips you earn! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional gameplay modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Hop to it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Bellhop, maintaining the smooth operation of a small hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tips by fulfilling daily clients' needs for food, coffee, towels and beddings. Improve and upgrade your tools of the trade to fulfill needs faster and earn bigger tips.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun gameplay loop based on meeting the daily needs of clients. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels throughout four seasons that introduce unique challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and buy upgrades with the tips you earn! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional gameplay modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Hop to it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Bellhop is a hotel management game. Earn tips by bringing the guests the items they request. Use your savings to upgrade and improve your tools, or to spice up your wardrobe.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
